</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>위치 확인 지연, 결제 화면 오류 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>시민 만족도 조사 결과 3.4/5.0</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>앱 개선 의견은 아래와 같음:</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>대여 가능 여부 실시간 업데이트</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>반납소 혼잡도 표시 기능 추가</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>1일 이용권 간편 결제 버튼 배치</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅳ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Hei